source={'image_path':image['path'],'image_sha256':image['sha256'],'image_bytes':image['bytes'],'sglang_git_head':'29481685462732237d80d86076d6563e1f658102','extraction':'Selected source files read-only extracted from the pinned image; no source/candidate file was edited.','files':[{'path':'sgl-workspace/sglang/python/sglang/srt/speculative/eagle_worker_common.py','sha256':'df292a8852278c0d2fee146db7859de6f15370b9427b99f8b646f8e0dff85b5f','lines':'461-588','finding':'Builds the target verification forward batch from EAGLE draft tokens, runs target_worker.forward_batch_generation(is_verify=True), then calls eagle_sample.'},{'path':'sgl-workspace/sglang/python/sglang/srt/speculative/eagle_utils.py','sha256':'3c71d7ef97a12a345614c5d40cc7a176ab79afa40013cd7fcd4a6c8067fe87bc','lines':'646-736; 371-395','finding':'When all requests are greedy, applies torch.argmax to next_token_logits for all verification rows and passes the results through the CUDA verify_tree_greedy kernel.'},{'path':'sgl-workspace/sglang/python/sglang/srt/model_executor/model_runner.py','sha256':'221032bf7ae57d2ebdb96801150a48d23244840a9b7938dc586e911671c11102','lines':'1643-1677','finding':'Ordinary decode uses the normal sampler and per-position decode positions; this is a distinct path from EAGLE batch verification.'},{'path':'sgl-workspace/sglang/python/sglang/srt/speculative/eagle_worker_v2.py','sha256':'c99bf6d52c6477f4afd7019d91de4e5a3845d3331a283bfdac41d8fcb11f9b21','lines':'1495-1510','finding':'EAGLE3 worker delegates to shared target verification using configured steps/top-k/draft-token count.'}]}
